OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOvernight
OL,6,Fwill see some patchy cloud and mostly
OL,7,Fclear spells across the region. It
OL,8,Fwill be a cool night, with
OL,9,Ftemperatures falling away steadily
OL,10,Fthrough the early hours.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FAny patchy cloud during the
OL,13,Fmorning will lift and break, leaving a
OL,14,Fdry and sunny day for all. Sunshine
OL,15,Fmay be hazy at times and it will feel
OL,16,Fwarm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
