OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells. Cloudier skies may
OL,7,Fdevelop for a time on Monday, with the
OL,8,Fslight chance of showers. Warm on
OL,9,FSaturday, with warm conditions
OL,10,Fcontinuing early next week.
